 "traps": [
  "three build systems share the root: pom.xml (Maven, Spring Boot), package.json (npm) and angular.json (one Angular project with root \"\" and sourceRoot src/main/webapp); the npm package and the Angular project have the same name jhipster-sample-application; references by that name mean the npm package for dependencies, Vitest, Cypress and the build calls, and the angular-project for Angular, Bootstrap and the HTTP clients in connections",
  "the two halves call each other: package.json scripts run ./mvnw, and the Maven webapp profile (active by default) runs npm through frontend-maven-plugin with its own Node v24.21.0 and npm 12.0.2",
  "the Angular build writes to target/classes/static/, the Maven output folder, so the Spring Boot jar serves the front end",
  "there is no package-lock.json in the repository: every npm version is written exact in package.json, but resolved stays null",
  "Java is asked five ways: java.version 21 in pom.xml, the jib base image eclipse-temurin:25-jre-noble, the workflow's java-version 17.x, the devcontainer VARIANT 21-bullseye and the devcontainer Dockerfile default VARIANT 17",
  "Node is asked four ways: node.version v24.21.0 in pom.xml, engines >=24.21.0, NODE_VERSION 24.21.0 in the devcontainer and 20.15.0 in the workflow (both as env NODE_VERSION and setup-node)",
  "maven.version 3.2.5 is the minimum checked by the enforcer; the wrapper asks for Maven 3.9.16 with distributionType only-script, yet .mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar is committed",
  "npmw and npmw.cmd are generator wrappers like mvnw: they install Node through ./mvnw -Pwebapp frontend:install-node-and-npm before running npm",
  "the whole repository is the output of generator-jhipster 9.4.0 (.yo-rc.json, .jhipster/*.json, GeneratedByJHipster.java): it is kept and edited as project code, not excluded as generated",
  "tsconfig.json maps eleven aliases, among them a catch-all * to src/main/webapp/*, so app/... imports resolve from the source root",
  "the Angular build uses @angular-builders/custom-esbuild with two esbuild plugins in build-plugins/, and defines SERVER_API_URL as an empty string: every client call is relative to the page origin",
  "the dev server on port 9060 proxies /api, /management, /v3/api-docs and /h2-console to the back end on 127.0.0.1:8080 (proxy.config.mjs)",
  "src/test/java holds two source trees with different roots: io.github.jhipster.sample tests and the Gatling simulations in package gatling.simulations",
  "Spring Boot's docker compose support starts src/main/docker/services.yml (PostgreSQL) when the app starts; Prometheus, Grafana, JHipster Control Center and SonarQube are in separate compose files that nothing starts automatically",
  "Ehcache is the Hibernate second-level cache inside the JVM, not an external service",
  "the cypress fixture integration-test.png and the TLS keystore keystore.p12 are binary files inside source folders",
  "languages lists programming and markup languages only; JSON, YAML, XML, CSV and properties files are present and not listed",
  "connections is a sample of 27 points: the REST resources with the Angular services that call them, the management endpoints used by the admin screens, the OpenAPI groups, the static build output, the two build tools calling each other and the two databases"
 ]
}
